@startuml
title DMS - Use Case Utama

left to right direction

actor "Pegawai" as Pegawai
actor "PPK" as PPK
actor "PPSPM" as PPSPM
actor "Kepala Sub Bagian Umum" as KSB
actor "Penanggung Jawab Kinerja" as PJK
actor "Admin Sistem" as Admin

rectangle "Dynamic Document Workflow Management System" {
  usecase "Login / Logout" as UCLogin
  usecase "Ganti Peran" as UCSwitchRole
  usecase "Kelola Dokumen" as UCDokumen
  usecase "Validasi Dokumen" as UCValidasi
  usecase "Setujui Dokumen" as UCSetujui
  usecase "Kelola Berkas Arsip" as UCBerkas
  usecase "Kelola Dokumen Manual" as UCManual
  usecase "Kelola Laporan Kinerja" as UCLaporan
  usecase "Kelola User dan Master Data" as UCAdmin
}

Pegawai --> UCLogin
Pegawai --> UCSwitchRole
Pegawai --> UCDokumen

PPK --> UCLogin
PPK --> UCSwitchRole
PPK --> UCValidasi

PPSPM --> UCLogin
PPSPM --> UCSwitchRole
PPSPM --> UCSetujui

KSB --> UCLogin
KSB --> UCSwitchRole
KSB --> UCBerkas
KSB --> UCManual

PJK --> UCLogin
PJK --> UCSwitchRole
PJK --> UCLaporan

Admin --> UCLogin
Admin --> UCAdmin

note right of Admin
  Admin Sistem mengelola administrasi sistem.
  Admin Sistem bukan pengganti aktor operasional.
end note

note bottom of PPSPM
  PPSPM adalah label pengguna untuk peran internal BENDAHARA.
end note

note bottom of UCBerkas
  Berkas folder-first adalah authority arsip aktif.
end note

@enduml
